000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. LBLIO.
000300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000400 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000500 FILE-CONTROL.
000600     SELECT IDX-FILE ASSIGN TO IDXFILE
000700         ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
000800         ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
000900         RECORD KEY IS IDX-KEY
001000         FILE STATUS IS WS-STAT.
001100 DATA DIVISION.
001200 FILE SECTION.
001300 FD  IDX-FILE
001400     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
001500 01  IDX-REC.
001600     05 IDX-KEY  PIC X(4).
001700     05 IDX-DATA PIC X(8).
001800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001900 01  WS-STAT PIC XX.
002000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
002100 MAIN-PARA.
002200     OPEN OUTPUT IDX-FILE.
002300     MOVE "K001" TO IDX-KEY.
002400     MOVE "ORIGINAL" TO IDX-DATA.
002500     WRITE IDX-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY "WRITE FAILED".
002600     CLOSE IDX-FILE.
002700     OPEN I-O IDX-FILE.
002800     DISPLAY "OPEN I-O STATUS " WS-STAT.
002900     READ IDX-FILE AT END DISPLAY "NO RECORD".
003000     DISPLAY IDX-KEY " " IDX-DATA.
003100     MOVE "REWRITTN" TO IDX-DATA.
003200     REWRITE IDX-REC INVALID KEY DISPLAY "REWRITE FAILED".
003300     CLOSE IDX-FILE.
003400     DISPLAY "DONE".
003500     STOP RUN.
